# GMS hands out two charges off one 4-second cooldown. One charge here, so the
# cooldown is simply how often it fires -- and the fight has no notion of a
# player saving a charge for later anyway.
name: "Flash Blade"
description:
  "Zip forward in a flash, cutting everything in your path five times "
  "over. Goes off the moment it comes back."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_FIGHTER
max_level: 9
max_enemies: 6
lines: 5
cast_interval_seconds: 4.0
base { skill_pct: 1.05 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.05 }
